{"title": "ChatGPT has hit roughly 20% of Google Search volume, OpenAI says", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/03/chatgpt-has-hit-roughly-20-of-google-search-volume-openai-says/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/04/chatgpt-android-1.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">According to OpenAI, ChatGPT has managed to grow its search use to around 20% of Google Search’s total volume, a staggering figure.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/03/chatgpt-has-hit-roughly-20-of-google-search-volume-openai-says/#more-735594\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-03T11:55:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-05T17:57:14.657262+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Google will disable Search for students unless schools accept AI features in ‘Guided Learning’ push", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/03/google-search-ai-guided-learning-changes/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2024/01/Google-logo-CES-2024-6.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Google is today launching new AI settings for schools, but with the big catch that Search is fully disabled if AI features are turned off entirely.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/03/google-search-ai-guided-learning-changes/#more-735591\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-03T11:35:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-05T17:57:14.657262+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "‘Cyclon’ uses an old Google Pixel to let AI do literally everything for you – who wants this?", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/03/cyclon-uses-an-old-google-pixel-to-let-ai-do-literally-everything-for-you-who-wants-this/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2024/05/Pixel-8a-angled.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As the AI era continues to find its footing in the consumer market, “Cyclon” is a new smartphone/software experience that, to start, is reusing old Google Pixel phones with a software experience that literally uses AI to do every little thing. And my biggest question is just…  who actually wants this?</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/03/cyclon-uses-an-old-google-pixel-to-let-ai-do-literally-everything-for-you-who-wants-this/#more-735530\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-03T09:15:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-05T17:57:14.657262+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Google’s Stadia Controller dream lives on in the $50 Xbox Nano Controller", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/03/xbox-nano-controller-cloud-gaming-stadia/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2021/07/stadia_controller_android_tv_1.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Stadia Controller introduced the idea of connecting directly to cloud gaming via its own Wi-Fi connection and, while Google’s platform is long dead, that dream lives on in the latest Xbox Controller.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/03/xbox-nano-controller-cloud-gaming-stadia/#more-735569\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-03T09:05:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-05T17:57:14.657262+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
