{"title": "Google has fixed Android Auto issues on Samsung Galaxy phones running One UI 9 [U]", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/03/some-samsung-galaxy-phones-are-having-android-auto-issues-with-one-ui-9/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/06/Galaxy-S25-Ultra-camera-system-4.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Samsung’s Android 17-based One UI 9 update is rolling out more widely and, with it, some apparent issues with Android Auto on some Galaxy phones.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/03/some-samsung-galaxy-phones-are-having-android-auto-issues-with-one-ui-9/#more-735344\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-03T04:51:46+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-05T17:57:14.657262+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Google’s Ocarina of Time easter egg is a blast from the past", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/03/googles-ocarina-of-time-easter-egg-is-a-blast-from-the-past/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/11/google-search-zelda-november-2026-02.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you’re sick of AI search and all the business of modern Google search, this week’s Google easter egg will take you back 28 years to a simpler time when Ocarina of Time was the pinnacle of gaming, and Google was still a new name.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/03/googles-ocarina-of-time-easter-egg-is-a-blast-from-the-past/#more-735483\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-03T04:05:44+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-05T17:57:14.657262+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Android gaming is having a renaissance", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/03/android-gaming-is-having-a-renaissance/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/09/razer-prio-controller-3.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1200\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Good morning! Today I’m mourning the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Patrick_Stewart\">loss of Patrick Stewart</a> by rewatching <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Star_Trek:_First_Contact\">First Contact</a>, my favorite Trek movie; beginning a marathon listen of at least one <a href=\"https://podcast.feedspot.com/star_trek_podcasts/\">great Star Trek podcast</a>; and replaying <a href=\"https://redirect.viglink.com/?key=b8f771eed689587b82c4635131ce08d7&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gog.com%2Fen%2Fgame%2Fstar_trek_voyager_elite_force&cuid=danielbader%3ACDHTCI\">Elite Force</a> and <a href=\"https://redirect.viglink.com/?key=b8f771eed689587b82c4635131ce08d7&u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gog.com%2Fen%2Fgame%2Fstar_trek_armada&cuid=danielbader%3AXBFHNE\">Armada</a>, both wonderful Trek games released in 2000.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Inbox</em> is the tech newsletter that goes beyond the news cycle. We cover the most important 9to5Google stories from the last couple of days along with a few highlights from around the web. We publish every Tuesday and Thursday, and if you like what you read, <a href=\"https://9to5google.beehiiv.com/subscribe\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">please subscribe</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/03/android-gaming-is-having-a-renaissance/#more-735403\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-03T03:00:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-05T17:57:14.657262+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidenc