{"title": "What’s new in Android Nov. 2026 Google System Updates: Android photo backup with Quick Share for Windows", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/02/november-2026-google-system-updates/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/01/google-play-services-1.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The monthly “<a href=\"https://support.google.com/product-documentation/answer/14343500\">Google System Release Notes</a>” primarily detail what’s new in Play services, Play Store, and Play system update across Android phones/tablets, Wear OS, Google/Android TV, Auto, and PC. Some features apply to end users, while others are aimed at developers.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/02/november-2026-google-system-updates/#more-735429\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-02T13:48:58+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-05T17:57:14.657262+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
