{"title": "Google will let Android & iOS apps directly integrate Quick Share next year", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/02/quick-share-sdk-apps/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/11/Quick-Share-SDK.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Android Dev Summit 2026, Google announced a Quick Share SDK that will let Android and iOS apps directly integrate the peer-to-peer file sharing capability.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/02/quick-share-sdk-apps/#more-735389\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-02T08:51:35+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-05T17:57:14.657262+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
